		(uuid "054e9250-fada-42f0-a32a-cee1f0bae503")
	)
	(text "R801/R802 = 4.7k pull-ups for provisional 400 kHz short sensor bus. Consolidate pull-ups if this bus is later shared with BMM350/PMIC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 171 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0fae67fc-3b63-413a-9e20-a25217c7be12")
	)
	(text "MAX30208: GPIO1=GND and GPIO0=GND => fixed 7-bit address 0x50; temperature is polled, no interrupt pin consumed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 186 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1168ccac-d321-4fb4-9928-ec01cc76589b")
	)
	(text "BMP585 mechanical: pressure port must breathe through a hydrophobic/ePTFE vent; never cover the port with adhesive or conformal coating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 206 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4f229f03-b198-45fe-833c-209c483d053b")
	)
	(text "08_ENVIRONMENT — BMP585 BAROMETER + MAX30208 SKIN TEMPERATURE + OPT4001 AMBIENT LIGHT — REV A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7110294a-f1db-42f4-8faa-9b2030b30cbe")
	)
	(text "OPT4001 mechanical: provide a real optical window / bezel opening; do not place behind opaque AMOLED or black mask."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 201 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "754cb9f8-d553-499e-8988-736ffcf08a45")
	)
	(text "All three sensors use VOUT1_1V8. ENV_I2C_SDA/SCL are a 1.8 V I2C bus; Apollo pin assignment is deferred."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 166 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "761e99b7-eae4-4a46-9ea9-740a6f066dbe")
	)
	(text "OPT4001DTSR: ADDR=GND => 0x44; ALS_INT is open-drain and uses R803=10k pull-up. C801=100nF at VDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 196 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a110b8db-2364-409b-a4db-cccc6282f64e")
	)
	(text "MAX30208 placement: skin-facing and thermally isolated from PMIC/SoC/PPG LEDs; thin traces/cutouts or flex improve skin tracking."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 191 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b9f4cbdd-d53e-499b-85ee-92dbaaa99dca")
	)
	(text "BMP585: I2C mode; CSB=1.8 V, SDO=GND => 7-bit address 0x46; BARO_INT reserved for data-ready/interrupt."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 176 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d0274a4b-d2ff-432a-a138-bd1a7e543109")
	)
	(text "BMP585: C803/C804 = 100nF at VDDIO/VDD. If either rail ramps faster than 10 us, Bosch recommends 10 ohm series limiting."
